  "transcript": [
    {
      "approx_t": 0.0,
      "text": "Raghav Juyal went from looking like this to this."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 3.0,
      "text": "And you might think it's just because of his fashion, but it's actually his hair and beard game."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 8.0,
      "text": "Raghav has a long face, narrow chin, and a long neck."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 12.0,
      "text": "Earlier his hair was shorter on the sides with volume on top and a short beard."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 16.0,
      "text": "This made his face look even longer and his head felt smaller against his frame."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 21.0,
      "text": "Now, he does almost the opposite."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 23.0,
      "text": "His curls grow outward around the temple and ears, which visually adds width to his face."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 28.0,
      "text": "And instead of growing his beard downwards, he keeps volume around the cheeks and jaw, which makes the lower half of his face look broader."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 35.0,
      "text": "So if you have a long rectangular face, remember the rule is don't add more length, add width."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 41.0,
      "text": "Go for a full short beard, a boxed beard, a heavy stubble, or a Garibaldi-style beard."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 46.0,
      "text": "And for hair, go for grown-out curls, a textured medium-length, or a layered shag."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 52.0,
      "text": "But avoid tight fades and high pompadours because they'll make your face look even longer."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 57.0,
      "text": "For more grooming tips..."
    }
  ],
